{"name":"Quest","hex":"#bdc1c1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Quest","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname from German."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Quest"}],"entries":[{"title":"Quest","blocks":[{"text":"A quest is a journey toward a specific mission or a goal. It serves as a plot device in mythology and fiction: a difficult journey towards a goal, often symbolic or allegorical. Tales of quests figure prominently in the folklore of every nation and ethnic culture."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quest"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Quest_of_the_white_hart_-_738326.jpg/330px-Quest_of_the_white_hart_-_738326.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Quest_of_the_white_hart_-_738326.jpg/330px-Quest_of_the_white_hart_-_738326.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Quest of the White Hart (1912), an Arthurian illustration by F. A. Fraser","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AQuest_of_the_white_hart_-_738326.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg/500px-Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg/1280px-Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg/500px-Theodor_Kittelsen%2C_Soria_Moria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Soria Moria by Theodor Kittelsen: a hero glimpses the end of his quest","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATheodor_Kittelsen